    "There was a fair",
    "steady breeze and",
    "we got under weigh",
    "early in the morning",
    "and all day long",
    "we sailed in a",
    "straight course",
    "by the low",
    "& sandy bluffs",
    "of the Long",
    "Island coast;",
    "I passed a good",
    "of deal of time in",
    "the cross trees, whist",
